  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to conduct cultural interventions which promote dialogue, build understanding and foster a shared sense of ownership of cultural heritage among all Kosovo communities. In Kosovo cultural heritage has proved a successful entry point on re-building trust and improving inter-community acceptance as it addresses the need for respect of cultural identity and heritage of all. The envisaged result of the output is improved inter-ethnic acceptance through protection of cultural and religiou</narrative>
  </description>
